@risk = http://localhost:8085

### Spring Boot Actuator health (public)
GET {{risk}}/actuator/health

### Rule set (paste RISK_ENGINE_API_KEY from backend/.env)
GET {{risk}}/api/v1/risk/rules
X-Api-Key: PASTE_RISK_ENGINE_API_KEY

### Score a transfer: Rs 1,23,456 to a payee added 3 hours ago (expect 45, MEDIUM, STEP_UP)
POST {{risk}}/api/v1/risk/assess
X-Api-Key: PASTE_RISK_ENGINE_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 12345600, "rail": "NEFT", "channel": "NET_BANKING", "ownAccountTransfer": false,
  "beneficiaryAgeHours": 3, "transfersLastHour": 0, "amountLast24h": 0, "dailyLimit": 100000000,
  "averageDebit90d": 10000000, "hourOfDayIst": 11, "accountAgeDays": 400, "kycVerified": true
}

### Validation error (RFC 9457 problem details)
POST {{risk}}/api/v1/risk/assess
X-Api-Key: PASTE_RISK_ENGINE_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": -1, "rail": "NEFT", "channel": "NET_BANKING", "ownAccountTransfer": false, "hourOfDayIst": 30 }
